	"Description": "[size=3]Feenbucht Farm is a tiny custom farm designed for a comfy single player experience.[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[img]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/mods/1303/images/15132/15132-1709348995-1066485404.png[/img]\n<br />\n<br />[size=3][b]Features of the farm:[/b][/size]\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*][size=3]Small quarry that spawns ores[/size]\n<br />[*][size=3]Pack of large stumps that respawn daily[/size]\n<br />[*][size=3]Unlockable swimming pond[/size]\n<br />[*][size=3]Low chance for weed to transform[/size]\n<br />[*][size=3]Occasionally wild flowers will bloom in the farm[/size]\n<br />[*][size=3]Snails visit the pastures[/size]\n<br />[*][size=3]Wild Foragery might grow in the farm[/size]\n<br />[*][size=3]Approximately 900 tillable tiles[/size]\n<br />[*][size=3]Custom made start furniture[/size]\n<br />[*][size=3]Forest and Town fish catchable at reduced rates[/size]\n<br />[/list]",
